<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- Surfacing (open sea) -->
  <!-- EN: Surface -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Label>上浮</DepthRim.Surface.Label>
  <!-- EN: Blow the ballast and rise to the open sea above. The hull floats on the sea surface map of this tile; dive again from the helm.\n\nThe submarine must be stopped, under open water without ice. From deeper down it first rises to the shallows (an hour per tier, longer with too little ballast) and surfaces when it gets there. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Desc>吹除壓載，浮到正上方的海面。船體會浮在這一格的海面地圖上；之後從艦橋下潛。\n\n潛艇要停著，而且上面是沒有冰的海。在較深處會先往上爬到淺海（每層一小時，壓載不夠更久），到了就上浮。</DepthRim.Surface.Desc>
  <!-- EN: The submarine has no hull. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.NoHull>潛艇沒有船體。</DepthRim.Surface.NoHull>
  <!-- EN: The submarine is under way. Stop first. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.InFlight>潛艇正在航行，先停下來。</DepthRim.Surface.InFlight>
  <!-- EN: Rise to {0} depth first. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.NotShallow>先上升到{0}。</DepthRim.Surface.NotShallow>
  <!-- EN: There is land above, not sea. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Land>上面是陸地，不是海。</DepthRim.Surface.Land>
  <!-- EN: There is an ice shelf above: hundreds of metres of ice that no submarine can break. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Shelf>上面是冰棚：幾百公尺厚的冰，任何潛艇都頂不開。</DepthRim.Surface.Shelf>
  <!-- EN: The sea above is frozen ({0} m of ice). Use ice-breaking surfacing. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Iced>上面的海結冰了（冰厚 {0} m），要用破冰上浮。</DepthRim.Surface.Iced>
  <!-- EN: {0} is already above. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Occupied>上面已經有{0}。</DepthRim.Surface.Occupied>
  <!-- EN: There is no room for the hull at {0}. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.NoRoom>{0}沒有地方放得下船體。</DepthRim.Surface.NoRoom>
  <!-- EN: Surfacing -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Surfacing>上浮中</DepthRim.Surface.Surfacing>
  <!-- EN: Surfaced -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.LetterLabel>浮出海面</DepthRim.Surface.LetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: {0} blew its ballast and broke the surface. The hull is riding the open sea.\n\nDive again from the helm when you are ready. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.LetterText>{0}吹除壓載，衝出了海面，船體正浮在開放海面上。\n\n準備好之後從艦橋下潛。</DepthRim.Surface.LetterText>

  <!-- Diving from the surface -->
  <!-- EN: Flood the ballast and sink back into the ocean below, then on down to the chosen depth. Everything on the hull goes with it; whatever is off the hull stays behind. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.DiveDesc>注水入壓載艙，沉回下方海洋，再下潛到選擇的深度。船體上的一切都會跟著走；不在船體上的東西留在原地。</DepthRim.Surface.DiveDesc>
  <!-- EN: The submarine is not on the surface. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.NotSurfaced>潛艇不在水面上。</DepthRim.Surface.NotSurfaced>
  <!-- EN: The helm is not on a hull held by keel frames. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.NotOnHull>艦橋不在龍骨框架撐住的船體上。</DepthRim.Surface.NotOnHull>
  <!-- EN: There is no free, navigable ocean below. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.NoSeaBelow>下面沒有空著、可以航行的海。</DepthRim.Surface.NoSeaBelow>
  <!-- EN: Diving -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Diving>下潛中</DepthRim.Surface.Diving>
  <!-- EN: {0} slipped beneath the surface and is resting in the shallows. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Dived>{0}沉入水面之下，停在淺海。</DepthRim.Surface.Dived>

  <!-- Ice-breaking surfacing -->
  <!-- EN: Break through ice -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Label>破冰上浮</DepthRim.IceBreach.Label>
  <!-- EN: Hover up against the ice for an hour, then blow the main ballast and try to punch through.\n\nWhether it works depends on the ice thickness and temperature against the size of the hull (bigger hulls have more lift). If the ice only cracks, try again within a day: cracked ice gives way more easily. Every attempt damages the ice-breaker frames and needs six hours to reflood and recharge. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Desc>懸停上升、貼住冰底一小時，然後緊急吹除主壓載，試著把冰頂破。\n\n成不成功取決於冰厚與氣溫對上船體大小（船越大上浮力越大）。如果冰只是裂開，一天內再試一次：裂過的冰比較容易頂破。每次嘗試都會讓破冰結構受損，而且要六小時重新注水、充氣。</DepthRim.IceBreach.Desc>
  <!-- EN: No ice-breaker frame aboard. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.NoFrame>船上沒有破冰結構。</DepthRim.IceBreach.NoFrame>
  <!-- EN: Reflooding and recharging the ballast: {0} left. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Cooldown>壓載艙重新注水、充氣中：還要{0}。</DepthRim.IceBreach.Cooldown>
  <!-- EN: There is no ice above. Surface normally. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.NoIce>上面沒有冰，直接上浮。</DepthRim.IceBreach.NoIce>
  <!-- EN: The ice is {0} m thick, more than the ice-breaker frame can take ({1} m). -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.TooThick>冰厚 {0} m，超過破冰結構的上限（{1} m）。</DepthRim.IceBreach.TooThick>
  <!-- EN: Hovering under the ice, about to break through. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Hovering>正在冰下懸停，準備頂冰。</DepthRim.IceBreach.Hovering>
  <!-- EN: {0} is rising slowly against the ice. It will blow its ballast in an hour. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Begin>{0}正緩緩上升貼住冰底，一小時後吹除壓載。</DepthRim.IceBreach.Begin>
  <!-- EN: {0} gave up breaking the ice: {1} -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Cancelled>{0}放棄破冰：{1}</DepthRim.IceBreach.Cancelled>
  <!-- EN: cancelled. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelledByPlayer>已取消。</DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelledByPlayer>
  <!-- EN: the submarine moved or changed depth. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelledMoved>潛艇移動或改變了深度。</DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelledMoved>
  <!-- EN: Stop hovering -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelLabel>停止懸停</DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Call off the ice breach. The ballast blows in {0}. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelDesc>取消破冰。壓載將在{0}後吹除。</DepthRim.IceBreach.CancelDesc>
  <!-- EN: Hovering under the ice: breaking through in {0} -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.InspectHovering>冰下懸停：{0}後頂冰</DepthRim.IceBreach.InspectHovering>
  <!-- EN: Ice held -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.StuckLabel>冰頂不動</DepthRim.IceBreach.StuckLabel>
  <!-- EN: {0} slammed into the ice ({1} m thick) and could not move it (lift ratio {2}). The ice-breaker frames took the blow.\n\nFind thinner ice, a lead, or a bigger hull. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.StuckText>{0}撞上冰層（厚 {1} m），卻完全頂不動（上浮比 {2}）。破冰結構承受了衝擊。\n\n找薄一點的冰、冰間水道，或換一艘更大的船。</DepthRim.IceBreach.StuckText>
  <!-- EN: Ice cracked -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.PartialLabel>冰被頂裂</DepthRim.IceBreach.PartialLabel>
  <!-- EN: {0} cracked the ice ({1} m thick) but did not break through (lift ratio {2}). The ice-breaker frames are damaged.\n\nTry again within a day, once the ballast is recharged in six hours: the cracked ice will give way more easily. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.PartialText>{0}把冰層（厚 {1} m）頂裂了，但沒有穿透（上浮比 {2}）。破冰結構受損。\n\n六小時後壓載充好氣，在一天內再試一次：裂過的冰比較容易頂破。</DepthRim.IceBreach.PartialText>
  <!-- EN: Broke through the ice -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.SurfacedLabel>破冰出水</DepthRim.IceBreach.SurfacedLabel>
  <!-- EN: {0} punched up through {1} m of sea ice (lift ratio {2}) and is resting in the hole it broke.\n\nThe open water around the hull freezes over again. Dive before the ice around the hull grows thicker than 0.4 m, or use the ice-breaker frame to break free. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.SurfacedText>{0}頂破了 {1} m 厚的海冰（上浮比 {2}），停在自己撞開的破口裡。\n\n船體四周的開放水會重新結冰。在船體四周的冰長到 0.4 m 之前下潛，或者用破冰結構把冰撞開。</DepthRim.IceBreach.SurfacedText>
  <!-- EN: The hull burst through so hard that the ice shattered far around it. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Violent>船體衝出得太猛，四周的冰碎了一大片。</DepthRim.IceBreach.Violent>
  <!-- EN: The hull is frozen in ({0} m of ice around it, more than {1} m). Break free with the ice-breaker frame. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.FrozenIn>船體被凍住了（四周的冰厚 {0} m，超過 {1} m）。用破冰結構把冰撞開。</DepthRim.IceBreach.FrozenIn>
  <!-- EN: The hull is not frozen in. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.NotFrozen>船體沒有被凍住。</DepthRim.IceBreach.NotFrozen>
  <!-- EN: Break free -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.BreakFreeLabel>撞開凍冰</DepthRim.IceBreach.BreakFreeLabel>
  <!-- EN: Ram the ice around the hull with the ice-breaker frames until it is open water again. The frames share {0} damage. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.BreakFreeDesc>用破冰結構撞開船體四周的冰，讓它變回開放水。破冰結構平分 {0} 點傷害。</DepthRim.IceBreach.BreakFreeDesc>
  <!-- EN: The ice around the hull is broken open. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.BrokeFree>船體四周的冰已經撞開。</DepthRim.IceBreach.BrokeFree>
  <!-- EN: Breaks ice up to {0} m -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.FrameLimit>可破冰厚 {0} m</DepthRim.IceBreach.FrameLimit>
  <!-- EN: Must be under a roof: the frame braces the cabin roof. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.NeedsRoof>要蓋在屋頂下：破冰結構要頂住艙頂。</DepthRim.IceBreach.NeedsRoof>
  <!-- EN: {0}, {1} m thick -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.SiteInspect>{0}，厚 {1} m</DepthRim.IceBreach.SiteInspect>

  <!-- Measuring the ice -->
  <!-- EN: Measure ice -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureLabel>量測冰層</DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureLabel>
  <!-- EN: Sound the ice above with the upward sonar and estimate whether the submarine can break through. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureDesc>用上視聲納量測上方的冰，估計潛艇能不能頂破。</DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureDesc>
  <!-- EN: {0} above: you can surface normally. -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureOpen>上方是{0}：可以直接上浮。</DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureOpen>
  <!-- EN: Ice above: {0}, {1} m thick{2}.\nAir temperature: {3} °C (flexural strength {4} MPa).\nHull: {5} cells.\n\nEstimated lift ratio: {6} → {7} -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureText>上方的冰：{0}，厚 {1} m{2}。\n氣溫：{3} °C（抗彎強度 {4} MPa）。\n船體：{5} 格。\n\n預估上浮比：{6} → {7}</DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureText>
  <!-- EN:  (a lead has opened here) -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureLead>（這裡裂開了一道冰間水道）</DepthRim.IceBreach.MeasureLead>
  <!-- EN: too thick for the ice-breaker frame -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.TooThick>太厚，超過破冰結構的上限</DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.TooThick>
  <!-- EN: the ice will not move -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Stuck>頂不動</DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Stuck>
  <!-- EN: the ice will crack but not break -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Partial>會頂裂但頂不穿</DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Partial>
  <!-- EN: breaks through -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Surfaced>頂得破</DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Surfaced>
  <!-- EN: bursts through violently -->
  <DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Violent>猛烈衝出</DepthRim.IceBreach.Result.Violent>

  <!-- EN: open sea -->
  <DepthRim.IceKind.None>開放海面</DepthRim.IceKind.None>
  <!-- EN: first-year sea ice -->
  <DepthRim.IceKind.FirstYear>一年冰</DepthRim.IceKind.FirstYear>
  <!-- EN: multi-year sea ice -->
  <DepthRim.IceKind.MultiYear>多年冰</DepthRim.IceKind.MultiYear>
  <!-- EN: ice shelf -->
  <DepthRim.IceKind.Shelf>冰棚</DepthRim.IceKind.Shelf>

  <!-- 海岸造船（M1）：灣裡造好的船下水 -->
  <!-- EN: There are no ballast tanks on this hull: it cannot dive. -->
  <DepthRim.Ballast.None>船體上沒有壓載水艙，不能下潛。</DepthRim.Ballast.None>
  <!-- EN: Ballast: none (can only rise, slowly). -->
  <DepthRim.Ballast.InspectNone>壓載：沒有（只能往上，而且最慢）。</DepthRim.Ballast.InspectNone>
  <!-- EN: Ballast: {0} tanks, lifting {1} of {2} hull cells. -->
  <DepthRim.Ballast.Inspect>壓載：{0} 座，撐得住 {1} 格（船體 {2} 格）。</DepthRim.Ballast.Inspect>
  <!-- EN: Not enough: depth changes take {0}x as long. -->
  <DepthRim.Ballast.InspectShort>不夠：換深度要 {0} 倍的時間。</DepthRim.Ballast.InspectShort>
  <!-- EN: Get everyone off the open deck first: {0}. -->
  <DepthRim.Dive.DeckOccupied>甲板上還有人，先讓他們進艙或下船：{0}。</DepthRim.Dive.DeckOccupied>
  <!-- EN: Hull not rated for this depth -->
  <DepthRim.HullWarn.Title>船殼撐不住這個深度</DepthRim.HullWarn.Title>
  <!-- EN: Target depth: {0}
Hull rating: {1} (weakest piece: {2})
Over by {3} tier(s).

The outward walls will be crushed bit by bit: the weakest loses about {4} HP a day. Once they break, the sea comes in.

Dive anyway? -->
  <DepthRim.HullWarn.Text>目標深度：{0}
船殼能耐：{1}（最弱的一塊：{2}）
超出 {3} 級。

朝外的艙壁會陸續被壓壞：最弱的那面每天約損失 {4} HP。壞了之後海水就會灌進來。

仍然下潛？</DepthRim.HullWarn.Text>
  <!-- EN: Hull overloaded -->
  <DepthRim.HullWarn.AlertLabel>船殼超載</DepthRim.HullWarn.AlertLabel>
  <!-- EN: These submarines are deeper than their hull is rated for. Their outward walls are being crushed; rise or rebuild them with stronger walls. -->
  <DepthRim.HullWarn.AlertDesc>這些潛艇在比船殼能耐更深的地方，朝外的艙壁正在被壓壞。往上，或換成更耐壓的牆。</DepthRim.HullWarn.AlertDesc>
  <!-- EN: Hull overloaded: rated for {0}. -->
  <DepthRim.HullWarn.Inspect>船殼超載：只撐得住{0}。</DepthRim.HullWarn.Inspect>
  <!-- EN: Rising to surface. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.InspectPending>正在往上，到淺海就上浮。</DepthRim.Surface.InspectPending>
  <!-- EN: {0} is rising from the {1} and will surface once it reaches the shallows. -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.Ascending>{0}正從{1}往上，到了淺海就上浮。</DepthRim.Surface.Ascending>
  <!-- EN: {0} reached the shallows but cannot surface: {1} -->
  <DepthRim.Surface.AscendBlocked>{0}到了淺海，但不能上浮：{1}</DepthRim.Surface.AscendBlocked>
  <!-- EN: Launch -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.Label>下水</DepthRim.Launch.Label>
  <!-- EN: Take the ship out of the bay onto the open sea next to the colony. ... -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.Desc>把船開出海灣，到殖民地旁邊的開放海面。龍骨框架撐住的整具船體、連同上面的人和東西都會一起走，灣裡恢復成原本的水。\n\n要回來時，開到殖民地旁邊的海上，用艦橋的「靠岸」。</DepthRim.Launch.Desc>
  <!-- EN: The ship is not in a coastal colony. -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.NotInPort>船不在海岸殖民地。</DepthRim.Launch.NotInPort>
  <!-- EN: The helm has no power. -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.NoPower>艦橋沒有電。</DepthRim.Launch.NoPower>
  <!-- EN: Retract the gangway first. -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.GangwayOut>先把舷梯收起來。</DepthRim.Launch.GangwayOut>
  <!-- EN: There is no open sea next to the colony to sail out to (land, or sea ice). -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.NoSea>殖民地旁邊沒有可以開出去的開放海面（是陸地或海冰）。</DepthRim.Launch.NoSea>
  <!-- EN: Launching -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.Launching>下水中</DepthRim.Launch.Launching>
  <!-- EN: Ship launched -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.LetterLabel>船已下水</DepthRim.Launch.LetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: The ship has left the bay and is now floating at {0}. -->
  <DepthRim.Launch.LetterText>船已經開出海灣，現在浮在{0}。</DepthRim.Launch.LetterText>

  <!-- 水面航行（M2） -->
  <!-- EN: Sail to... -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Option>航行到……</DepthRim.Sail.Option>
  <!-- EN: Ship {0} -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.DefaultName>船 {0}</DepthRim.Sail.DefaultName>
  <!-- EN: Stop here -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Stop>就地停船</DepthRim.Sail.Stop>
  <!-- EN: Stop the ship where it is now. If there is already a sea site here, the ship moors at it. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.StopDesc>讓船停在現在的位置。這一格已經有海面地點的話，就停靠在那裡。</DepthRim.Sail.StopDesc>
  <!-- EN: Stop the ship first. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.StopFirst>先把船停下來。</DepthRim.Sail.StopFirst>
  <!-- EN: The ship is not floating on the open sea. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.NotAtSea>船不是浮在開放海面上。</DepthRim.Sail.NotAtSea>
  <!-- EN: The ship is already under way. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.AlreadyUnderWay>船已經在航行中。</DepthRim.Sail.AlreadyUnderWay>
  <!-- EN: Two ships' keels are joined: separate them before sailing. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.ShipsLinked>兩艘船的龍骨連在一起：先拆開才能出航。</DepthRim.Sail.ShipsLinked>
  <!-- EN: No working surface thruster aboard. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.NoThruster>船上沒有能運作的水面推進器。</DepthRim.Sail.NoThruster>
  <!-- EN: The batteries aboard cannot run the thrusters for a single tile. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.NoCharge>船上電池的電連一格都走不了。</DepthRim.Sail.NoCharge>
  <!-- EN: Pick a tile on the surface. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.NotSurface>請選地表上的格子。</DepthRim.Sail.NotSurface>
  <!-- EN: The ship is already here. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Here>船已經在這裡了。</DepthRim.Sail.Here>
  <!-- EN: Not open sea (land or sea ice). -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.NotOpenSea>不是開放海面（陸地或海冰）。</DepthRim.Sail.NotOpenSea>
  <!-- EN: Too far: {0} tiles, the batteries last {1}. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.OutOfRange>太遠：要走 {0} 格，電池只夠 {1} 格。</DepthRim.Sail.OutOfRange>
  <!-- EN: {0} tiles, about {1} -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Eta>{0} 格，約 {1}</DepthRim.Sail.Eta>
  <!-- EN: Retracting the gangway; the ship sails once it is in. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.RetractingGangway>正在收起舷梯，收好就出航。</DepthRim.Sail.RetractingGangway>
  <!-- EN: The gangway could not be retracted: the ship stays. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.GangwayStuck>舷梯收不起來：船留在原地。</DepthRim.Sail.GangwayStuck>
  <!-- EN: Casting off -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Departing>出航中</DepthRim.Sail.Departing>
  <!-- EN: {0} is under way: {1} tiles to go. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Departed>{0}出航了：還有 {1} 格。</DepthRim.Sail.Departed>
  <!-- EN: {0}: the sea ahead has frozen over. The ship stops here. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.BlockedAhead>{0}：前方的海結冰了，船停在這裡。</DepthRim.Sail.BlockedAhead>
  <!-- EN: {0} has stopped. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Arrived>{0}已經停船。</DepthRim.Sail.Arrived>
  <!-- EN: {0} stopped next to {1}: there is no room to moor there. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.ArrivedNoRoom>{0}停在{1}旁邊：那裡沒有地方停靠。</DepthRim.Sail.ArrivedNoRoom>
  <!-- EN: {0} has moored at {1}. -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.ArrivedAt>{0}停靠在{1}。</DepthRim.Sail.ArrivedAt>
  <!-- EN: Mooring -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.Mooring>停靠中</DepthRim.Sail.Mooring>
  <!-- EN: Under way: {0} tiles to go, thrust {1} -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.InspectUnderWay>航行中：還有 {0} 格，推力 {1}</DepthRim.Sail.InspectUnderWay>
  <!-- EN: Drifting: no thrust ({0} tiles to go) -->
  <DepthRim.Sail.InspectStalled>漂流中：沒有推力（還有 {0} 格）</DepthRim.Sail.InspectStalled>

  <!-- 潛水鐘與吊架（M5） -->
  <!-- EN: Lower bell -->
